  "story": {
    "title": "Chintu and the Dragon",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Once there was a little boy named Chintu. He was travelling in a car with his family. Chintu liked to read story books. He picked up one and began to read.",
      "Suddenly he heard a big noise. He looked here and there and outside the window. Oh ! there was a big train which was running very fast. He remembered the poem \"Engine Engine Number 9\"",
      "Then Chintu's car was crossing a bridge. He felt he was riding on the back of a giant dragon with glittering eyes, curved teeth and a long tail. Chintu was scared because he thought that the dragon would take him away.",
      "Soon it was night. The stars were twinkling in the sky. He looked outside the window and saw a light house. Oh! this looks like a dragon. It was giving light to all the ships.",
      "Suddenly the dragon flew in the sky and it fired on all the clouds. But the clouds were full of hailstones. It began to rain and the dragon became calm.",
      "Soon Chintu reached home. He told his mother about the scenes he had seen. Mother said \" You have a very good imagination! Chintu, now let us sleep......\""
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Once there was a little boy named Chintu.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ngày xửa ngày xưa có một cậu bé tên là Chintu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He was travelling in a car with his family.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu bé đang đi ô tô cùng gia đình mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Chintu liked to read story books.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chintu thích đọc sách truyện."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He picked up one and began to read.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu bé nhặt một cuốn lên và bắt đầu đọc."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Suddenly he heard a big noise.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bỗng nhiên cậu bé nghe thấy một tiếng ồn lớn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He looked here and there and outside the window.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu bé nhìn khắp nơi và ra ngoài cửa sổ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Oh ! there was a big train which was running very fast.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ồ! Có một đoàn tàu lớn đang chạy rất nhanh."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He remembered the poem \"Engine Engine Number 9\"",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu bé nhớ bài thơ \"Engine Engine Number 9\"."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Then Chintu's car was crossing a bridge.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau đó, xe ô tô của Chintu đang đi qua một cây cầu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He felt he was riding on the back of a giant dragon with glittering eyes, curved teeth and a long tail.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu bé cảm thấy mình đang cưỡi trên lưng một con rồng khổng lồ với đôi mắt lấp lánh, răng cong và một cái đuôi dài."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Chintu was scared because he thought that the dragon would take him away.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chintu sợ hãi vì cậu bé nghĩ rằng con rồng sẽ mang cậu bé đi mất."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Soon it was night.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chẳng mấy chốc trời đã tối."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The stars were twinkling in the sky.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Những ngôi sao đang lấp lánh trên bầu trời."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He looked outside the window and saw a light house.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu bé nhìn ra ngoài cửa sổ và thấy một ngọn hải đăng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Oh! this looks like a dragon.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ồ! Cái này trông giống một con rồng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It was giving light to all the ships.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó đang chiếu sáng cho tất cả các con tàu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Suddenly the dragon flew in the sky and it fired on all the clouds.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bỗng nhiên con rồng bay lên trời và nó phun lửa vào tất cả các đám mây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But the clouds were full of hailstones.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng các đám mây đầy những viên mưa đá."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It began to rain and the dragon became calm.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trời bắt đầu mưa và con rồng trở nên bình tĩnh."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Soon Chintu reached home.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chẳng mấy chốc Chintu đã về đến nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He told his mother about the scenes he had seen.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu bé kể cho mẹ nghe về những cảnh tượng mình đã thấy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Mother said \" You have a very good imagination!",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ nói: \"Con có một trí tưởng tượng rất phong phú!\""
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Chintu, now let us sleep......\"",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_10999/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chintu, bây giờ chúng ta đi ngủ nhé......\""
      }
    ]
  },
